 May 2026 | 10:38 AMShort Information :<a title=\"CGPSC\" href=\"https://psc.cg.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"> Chhattisgarh Public Service Commission</span></a>has released the State Service Exam SSE recruitment advertisement for 238 posts. Those candidates who are Enrolled in this Chhattisgarh SSE recruitment can Download Pre Result. Read the notification for recruitment eligibility, post information, selection procedure, age limit, pay scale and all other information.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table border=\"1\" width=\"760\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"14\" valign=\"top\" width=\"620\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Chhattisgarh Public Service Commission (CGPSC)</b></span></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"color: #008000;\">CGPSC State Service Exam SSE Recruitment 2025</span></b></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b><strong>CGPSC <b>Advt No : 06/2025</b></strong> : Short Details of Notification</b></span></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b></b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\" width=\"347\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span><b></b></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Application Begin :<b> 01/12/2025</b></li>\n<li>Last Date for Apply Online :<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b>30/12/2025</b></span></li>\n<li>Last Date Pay Exam Fee :<b>30/12/2025</b></li>\n<li>Correction Date : <strong>31/12/2025 to 02/01/2026</strong></li>\n<li>Exam Date :<strong>22/02/2026</strong></li>\n<li>Admit Card Available : <b>11/02/2026</b></li>\n<li>Answer Key Available : <b>24/02/2026</b></li>\n<li>Pre Result Available : <b>26/03/2026</b></li>\n<li>Mains Exam Date :<strong>06-09 June 2026</strong></li>\n<li>Admit Card Available : <b>26/05/2026</b></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"273\">\n<h2 alig