\"620\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>How to Fill CGPSC SSE PCS Pre Recruitment Online Form 2025</b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>CGPSC SSE PCS Pre Recruitment for Various Post Candidate Can Apply Between <strong>01/12/2025 to 30/12/2025</strong></li>\n<li>Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Recruitment Application Form in CGPSC SSE PCS Pre Recruitment 2025.</li>\n<li>Kindly Check and Collect the All Document – Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</li>\n<li>Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form – Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</li>\n<li>Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</li>\n<li>If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</li>\n<li>Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"14\" valign=\"top\" width=\"620\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Interested Candidates Can Read the Full CGPSC SSE PCS Pre Exam 2025 Notification Before Apply Online</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"14\" valign=\"top\" width=\"620\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"328\">\n\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"292\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"14\" valign=\"top\" width=\"620\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Some Useful Important Links</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"328\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Download Admit Card (Mains)</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"292\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><b><a title=\"CGPSC SSE PCS Admit Card 2026\" href=\"https://online.ecgpsconline.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"328\">\